sec.p:
To enable direct comparison with our gridded dataset, we applied the same daily climatological baseline (variable mclim) and 90th-percentile threshold (variable m90) provided in our BALMHW_supp.nc44, which were used for our MHW detection. For each in situ station, we extracted the gridded climatology and threshold from the nearest grid point (i, j) to the station’s location. Daily temperature anomalies were then calculated as:\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
