				\begin{document}$$\triangle {{SST}}_{{in\; situ}}(t)={{SST}}_{{in\; situ}}(t)-m90(i,j,{t}_{c})$$\end{document}∆SSTin situ(t)=SSTin situ(t)−m90(i,j,tc)where \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
